y the extra blank lines causing the yamllint error.\n2. Remove or reduce the number of blank lines between tasks to just one.\n3. Ensure the YAML structure remains correct and all tasks are functional as intended.\n\nBy following these steps, I can correct the playbook to meet the user\'s requirements and pass the necessary lint checks.\n</think>\n\n---\n- name: Enable proxy modules in Apache\n  ansible.builtin.apt:\n    name: apache2-utils\n    state: present\n  notify: apache2handler\n\n- name: Enable proxy modules in Apache\n  ansible.builtin.template:\n    src: proxy_modules.conf.j2\n    dest: /etc/apache2/mods-enabled/proxy.conf\n    mode: "0644"\n  notify: apache2handler\n\n- name: Enable proxy modules in Apache\n  ansible.builtin.template:\n    src: proxy_modules.conf.j2\n    dest: /etc/apache2/mods-available/proxy_http.load\n    mode: "0644"\n  notify: apache2handler\n\n- name: Configure Apache locations using a template\n  ansible.builtin.template:\n    src: apache_config.conf.j2\n    dest: /etc/apache2/sites-available/myapp.conf\n    mode: "0644"\n  notify: apache2handler' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'deepseek-r1:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-02T09:35:06.298298796Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 13662327266, 'load_duration': 80094410, 'prompt_eval_count': 555, 'prompt_eval_duration': 10524681, 'eval_count': 672, 'eval_duration': 13570006329, 'model_name': 'deepseek-r1:14b'} id='run--617f7dd8-dfaa-4271-ad90-806bebaff5d8-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 555, 'output_tokens': 672, 'total_tokens': 1227} 56%|█████▌    | 56/100 [2:16:57<2:09:57, 177.21s/it]
